    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Each component, now",
      "description": "Prometheus's own up series per scrape job, all scraped through Envoy's mesh_http listener. Up means the last scrape of that component's metrics succeeded through Envoy; Down means it did not, which is either the component or its Envoy route.",
      "id": 2,
