    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Events that needed another try (per second)",
      "description": "Requeued: the worker's update still failed after Envoy's retries, so it put the event back. Dead-lettered: given up after 5 attempts, or the order was missing. Lost: even the put-back failed. Re-sent by the sweeper: orders still created 60 s after their last event. Rate over 5m; normal is 0.",
